###Request
POST https://testresources.virginatlantic.com/DEV/digital/Trip/trips/search HTTP/1.1

$[?(@.confirmationNum == 'CAONLY')]

###Response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "booking": {
    "id": "Test-booking-Id",
    "product": [
      {
        "slices": [
          {
            "segments": [
              {
                "origin": { "countryCode": "GB" },
                "destination": { "countryCode": "CA" }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "status": 200
}
